docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/COMPANION_PROTOCOL.md
docs/PORTING.md
docs/TECHNICAL.md
docs/TECHNICAL.zh-CN.md

# Local firmware and UI artifacts. Keep only the curated public preview.
artifacts/*
